WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.333
Down the center run columns of prayer — requests for bread, beer, linen, and every good thing, repeated forever.

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:11.500
These are not decorations.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Spoken by priests at the burial and written to be spoken eternally, the words themselves feed the dead, forever.

